      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Content Moderation Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud's Language API for content moderation within the `moderate_batch.py` script. It seems like a solid, well-documented choice. I'll need to figure out the authentication process and API integration now.\n\n\n**Selecting Vertex AI**\n\nI've shifted focus to Google Cloud's Vertex AI for this project, specifically the Content Moderation API. I'm moving beyond the initial API choice. The goal is now to implement this within the `moderate_batch.py` script. I'm starting to structure the Python code, including the necessary library imports, which will be the Google Cloud `aiplatform` library. I'm starting to build a function for moderating batches of messages. Let's get the ball rolling!\n\n\n",
