        "text": "**Defining Moderation Function**\n\nI've just finished creating the `moderate_batch.py` file. It's got the framework for Google Cloud Vertex AI Content Moderation, including a placeholder. I've also defined the `moderate_batch` function, which now accepts a project ID, location, and a list of messages. I've added comments to clarify these parameters and the function's purpose \u2013 to return moderation decisions.\n\n\n**Refining Function Implementation**\n\nI've updated the `moderate_batch` function to highlight that the current moderation logic is a placeholder. I've noted in the comments that the simulation will be swapped out for actual Vertex AI API calls. This clarifies that the core of this function is not implemented in a practical scenario, but the structure has been set for implementation later.\n\n\n",
